{"id":"506fa337f5ea6068","group":"90","path":"90/90-ex-self-reference-program.md","title":"Self-Referential Program Example","display":"ex-self-reference-program — Self-Referential Program Example","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-ex-self-reference-program","aliases":["90-ex-self-reference-program"],"display":"ex-self-reference-program — Self-Referential Program Example","depends_on":["[[90-thm-recursion-theorem]]","[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]","[[90-df-partial-function]]","[[90-df-program-numbering]]","[[90-lem-program-numbering]]","[[90-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-ex-self-reference-program"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-ex-self-reference-program</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-self-reference-program — Self-Referential Program Example"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b8b8df152b92c5d9\" href=\"?note=b8b8df152b92c5d9\" title=\"90-thm-recursion-theorem\">90-thm-recursion-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e860bc8bff2a4e39\" href=\"?note=e860bc8bff2a4e39\" title=\"90-df-partial-function\">90-df-partial-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" href=\"?note=5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" title=\"90-df-program-numbering\">90-df-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"42029390ebbb59c5\" href=\"?note=42029390ebbb59c5\" title=\"90-lem-program-numbering\">90-lem-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1802adc1900d4b34\" href=\"?note=1802adc1900d4b34\" title=\"90-df-acceptable-program-numbering\">90-df-acceptable-program-numbering</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>固定编号族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\varphi=(\\Phi_k)_{k\\ge1}\">\\(\\boldsymbol\\varphi=(\\Phi_k)_{k\\ge1}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e=\\varphi_e^{(1)}\">\\(\\varphi_e=\\varphi_e^{(1)}\\)</span> 及部分函数等号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\simeq\">\\(\\simeq\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" href=\"?note=5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" title=\"90-df-program-numbering\">90-df-program-numbering</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>要求 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1802adc1900d4b34\" href=\"?note=1802adc1900d4b34\" title=\"90-df-acceptable-program-numbering\">90-df-acceptable-program-numbering</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)\\)</span>；本书的具体编号满足该条件，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"42029390ebbb59c5\" href=\"?note=42029390ebbb59c5\" title=\"90-lem-program-numbering\">90-lem-program-numbering</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}_k,\\mathrm{PartRec}_k\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}_k,\\mathrm{PartRec}_k\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\varphi_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\((\\varphi_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> (acceptable numbering of unary partial computable functions)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\)</span> (total recursive index transformer)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\simeq\">\\(\\simeq\\)</span> (extensional equality of partial functions)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}self\\text{-}reference\\text{-}program}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\varphi_e\\simeq\\varphi_{f(e)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}self\\text{-}reference\\text{-}program}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\varphi_e\\simeq\\varphi_{f(e)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>将所给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 代入 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"b8b8df152b92c5d9\" href=\"?note=b8b8df152b92c5d9\" title=\"90-thm-recursion-theorem\">90-thm-recursion-theorem</a>；该定理的编号条件正是本文件显式列出的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AcceptNum}\">\\(\\mathrm{AcceptNum}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>固定点保证程序行为的外延相等，并不要求程序文本或索引相等。</li>\n<li>取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 为“把索引嵌入生成程序”的编译变换，可得到访问自身索引的程序；quine 是其特例。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-thm-recursion-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"b8b8df152b92c5d9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-thm-recursion-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"137d75d038de4a47","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"e860bc8bff